## 3. Data Integration with Pandas

`tm1py` interfaces cleanly with `pandas` for advanced data science workflows.

### Fetching Cube Data directly into a Pandas DataFrame
```python
# Returns a ready-to-use DataFrame matching your MDX layout
df = tm1.cubes.cells.execute_mdx_dataframe(mdx)
print(df.head())
```

### Writing a Pandas DataFrame back to a TM1 Cube
Ensure your DataFrame columns match the exact sequence of your cube dimensions, ending with the value column.
```python
# df structure: ['Version', 'Period', 'Account', 'Value']
tm1.cubes.cells.write_dataframe(cube_name="Finance", dataframe=df)
```

