## 4. Dimension & Element Management

### Checking & Creating Dimensions
```python
# Check existence
if not tm1.dimensions.exists("Region"):
    print("Dimension not found")

# Get all dimension names
all_dims = tm1.dimensions.get_all_names()
```

### Managing Elements (Elements, Attributes)
```python
# Add a leaf (Numeric) element to a dimension
tm1.dimensions.element.create(dimension_name="Region", element_name="Texas", element_type="Numeric")

# Add an element attribute (Alias)
tm1.dimensions.element.create_element_attribute(
    dimension_name="Region", 
    attribute_name="Local Name", 
    attribute_type="Alias"
)
```

