## 5. Executing Chops & Processes

Trigger TurboIntegrator (TI) processes directly from Python scripts.

### Running a Process without Parameters
```python
tm1.processes.execute(process_name="Update_All_Hierarchies")
```

### Running a Process with Parameters
Pass arguments into TI parameters via a Python dictionary.
```python
parameters = {
    "pVersion": "Forecast",
    "pYear": "2026"
}
tm1.processes.execute_with_return(process_name="Copy_Version_Data", parameters=parameters)
```

---

## 6. Chores Management

### Triggering and Activating Chores
```python
# Execute an administrative chore instantly
tm1.chores.execute(chore_name="Nightly_Maintenance")

# Enable or disable scheduled tasks
tm1.chores.activate(chore_name="Hourly_Data_Sync")
tm1.chores.deactivate(chore_name="Hourly_Data_Sync")